Z||000000||gabriel||02-15-2001||11:17 AM||||  Hi everyone.<P>  One thing I can't get going yet is the electric trunk latch.  Latch itself works fine. Trunk courtesy light now works. The little red light in the dash switch now works.  If I take off the switch & disconnect it, which two wires in the connector get shorted to test?  Or is there another test?  The park switch (auto) seems to be fine.  There is no rear window defogger.<P>  There is a connector at the lower column on the passenger side that I think once plugged into a pulse wiper system.  The RPO codes show one, but wipers don't pulse.  <P>  There is also a single pin connector on the fuse box mount that I am guessing once held a courtesy light, as there are no courtesy lights in this car.<P>  I'm thinking of replacing the body harness.  Do they still make them?<BR>This car must have had zero maintainence for the electrical system. As each thing needed repair, they simply removed or disconnected that system. Makes it a little harder to repair a system that isn't even there. Geez ... <P>||||reg||5
